        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ba̱r Dee-bid kɛ rɔ kä Thɔɔl",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid wä kä bo̱o̱th palä ni Ä-ɣi-mɛ-lɛk kä Nob. Kä cuɛ Dee-bid lor kɛ dual thiecɛ jɛ i̱, “Ɛŋu jäli kä rɔa mɔ, a thilɛ ram jäl kɛɛl kɛ ji̱?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid ɛ loc i̱, “Ci kuäär ɣä ja̱k kɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱r, kä cɛ ɣä jiök i̱, ‘A thil ram mi ŋäc duɔ̱ɔ̱r kä min ja̱kä ji̱ kɛ jɛ.’ Tëë kɛ gua̱a̱th mi cä lat kɛ ŋuɛ̈tni i̱ ba̱kɔ röm thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ ɛŋu tëë ji̱ mɔ? Mocä kɛ jurayni da̱ŋ dhieec kiɛ mɔ te thi̱n ɔ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu bo̱o̱th palä Dee-bid loc i̱, “Thilɛ ɣä jurayni baaŋ, te ni jurayni tin rɛ̈l kɛ rɔ̱ thi̱n. Ɛ ni mi ŋuɛ̈tni tɔ̱tɔ̱ /ka̱n rɔ thieek kɛ män.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid ɛ loc i̱, “Kɛ thuɔ̱k na̱n män kɛ nɛy ce̱tnikɛ ta̱a̱ in wen mi wa̱kɔ ja̱l. Kɛn kuak ŋuɛ̈tni rɛ̈l kɛ rɔ̱, a cäŋɛ ja̱l baaŋ bä. Kä dëë gɔɔydiɛn ku lɛ ce̱tkɛ ŋu ɛn walɛ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cu bo̱o̱th palä jɛ ka̱m jurayni tin rɛ̈l kɛ rɔ̱, kɛ ɣöö thilɛ jurayni ti kɔ̱ŋ, ɛ ni kɛn jurayni tin rɛ̈l kɛ rɔ, tin /ca woc nhiam Kuɔth Nhial, tin la gua̱a̱thdiɛn a gua̱lkɛ kɛ jurayni ti lëth lëëth kɛ cäŋ in wuɔckɛ nikɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ tëë kɛ läät Thɔɔl mi te thi̱n, mi lät nyin palä Kuɔth Nhial. Ɛ raan Ɛ-dɔm mi cɔali Do-yeg, kuäär yieen ɣɔ̱ɔ̱k Thɔɔl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid Ä-ɣi-mɛ-lɛk jiök i̱, “Kä thilɛ ji̱ mut kiɛ thɛp mi te kuthdu? Kɛ ɣöö/ka̱n mutdä kiɛ thɛpdä nööŋ kɛ ɣä kɛɛl, kɛ ɣöö kuäär go̱o̱rɛ nɔmɔ kɛ pɛ̈th.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu bo̱o̱th palä jɛ loc i̱, “Thɛp Gɔl-yath raan Pi-li-thɛt mëë näk i̱ lo̱o̱lä Elaa, ja wa̱nɛ ca rith kɛ bi̱i̱ jɔk gaakni. Mi go̱o̱ri jɛ käni jɛ kɛ ɣöö thilɛ mi dɔ̱ŋ, te ni jɛn thi̱n.” Kä cu Dee-bid wee i̱, “Thilɛ mi cäät kɛ jɛ. Käm ni jɛ ɣä.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid rɔ bar ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ kɛ Thɔɔl, cuɛ wä kä A-kic Kuäär Gɛ̈th. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu läät A-kic wee i̱, “Ɛn nɛmɛ /ciɛ Dee-bid kuäär wec? /Ciɛ jɛn ɛ nëë puanykɛ kɛ diit buul i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
